| Time2D: times desktop copies and fills on the CPU and the GPU (V3DRender
| 0.19), writes Time2DOut here. Draws on part of the screen for about 3
| minutes: leave the mouse alone. Press Space at the end.
Set V3DCheck$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.25 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.V3DRender
